{"availability":"available","full":"valhalla/valhalla","name":"valhalla","description":"Open Source Routing Engine for OpenStreetMap","category":"Other","language":"C++","stars":6327,"forks":1003,"created":"2016-01-19T19:42:29Z","updated":"2026-10-16T07:41:51Z","license":null,"branch":"master","homepage":"https://valhalla.github.io/valhalla/","topics":["astar","dijkstra","directions","isochrones","multi-modal","openstreetmap","routing","routing-engine","tiled","traveling-salesman"],"demo":"https://fossgis.de/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T08:20:29.460Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T08:20:29.460Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T08:20:29.460Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T22:54:56.985Z","stars":6290,"forks":1001},{"at":"2026-10-09T23:11:17.472Z","stars":6297,"forks":1001},{"at":"2026-10-10T13:03:37.009Z","stars":6298,"forks":1002},{"at":"2026-10-16T08:20:29.460Z","stars":6327,"forks":1003}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["██▒ █▓ ▄▄▄ ██▓ ██░ ██ ▄▄▄ ██▓ ██▓ ▄▄▄ ▓██ █▒░▒██ ▀█▄ ▒██░ ▒██▀▀██░▒██ ▀█▄ ▒██░ ▒██░ ▒██ ▀█▄ ▒██ █░░░██▄▄▄▄██ ▒██░ ░▓█ ░██ ░██▄▄▄▄██ ▒██░ ▒██░ ░██▄▄▄▄██ ▒▀█░ ▓█ ▓██▒░██████▒░▓█▒░██▓ ▓█ ▓██▒░██████▒░██████▒▓█ ▓██▒ ░ ▐░ ▒▒ ▓▒█░░ ▒░▓ ░ ▒ ░░▒░▒ ▒▒ ▓▒█░░ ▒░▓ ░░ ▒░▓ ░▒▒ ▓▒█░ ░ ░░ ▒ ▒▒ ░░ ░ ▒ ░ ▒ ░▒░ ░ ▒ ▒▒ ░░ ░ ▒ ░░ ░ ▒ ░ ▒ ▒▒ ░ ░░ ░ ▒ ░ ░ ░ ░░ ░ ░ ▒ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ▒ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░","Valhalla is an open source routing engine and accompanying libraries for use with OpenStreetMap data. Valhalla also includes tools like time+distance matrix computation, isochrones, elevation sampling, map matching and tour optimization (Travelling Salesman).","There are several key features that we hope can differentiate the Valhalla project from other routing and network analysis engines. They are:"],"features":["Tiled hierarchical data structure. Should allow users to have a small memory footprint on memory constrained devices, enable offline routing, provide a means for regional extracts and partial updates.","Dynamic, runtime costing of edges and vertices within the graph via a plugin architecture. Should allow for customization and alternate route generation.","C++ based API. Should allow for cross compilation of the various pieces to enable routing on offline portable devices.","A plugin based narrative and manoeuvre generation architecture. Should allow for generation that is customized either to the administrative area or to the target locale.","Multi-modal and time-based routes. Should allow for mixing auto, pedestrian, bike and public transportation in the same route or setting a time by which one must arrive at a location."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/valhalla/valhalla/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"29b22cba0cffc934cd2e47d37633b2e3cf6e46b8c74b804b542e514a45e68cbc","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T22:54:57.060Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:37.115Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"██▒ █▓ ▄▄▄ ██▓ ██░ ██ ▄▄▄ ██▓ ██▓ ▄▄▄ ▓██ █▒░▒██ ▀█▄ ▒██░ ▒██▀▀██░▒██ ▀█▄ ▒██░ ▒██░ ▒██ ▀█▄ ▒██ █░░░██▄▄▄▄██ ▒██░ ░▓█ ░██ ░██▄▄▄▄██ ▒██░ ▒██░ ░██▄▄▄▄██ ▒▀█░ ▓█ ▓██▒░██████▒░▓█▒░██▓ ▓█ ▓██▒░██████▒░██████▒▓█ ▓██▒ ░ ▐░ ▒▒ ▓▒█░░ ▒░▓ ░ ▒ ░░▒░▒ ▒▒ ▓▒█░░ ▒░▓ ░░ ▒░▓ ░▒▒ ▓▒█░ ░ ░░ ▒ ▒▒ ░░ ░ ▒ ░ ▒ ░▒░ ░ ▒ ▒▒ ░░ ░ ▒ ░░ ░ ▒ ░ ▒ ▒▒ ░ ░░ ░ ▒ ░ ░ ░ ░░ ░ ░ ▒ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ▒ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░ ░","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/valhalla/valhalla/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"29b22cba0cffc934cd2e47d37633b2e3cf6e46b8c74b804b542e514a45e68cbc","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/valhalla/valhalla/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:37.115Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T12:46:29Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/valhalla/valhalla/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:37.116Z","hash":"29b22cba0cffc934cd2e47d37633b2e3cf6e46b8c74b804b542e514a45e68cbc","originalBytes":14711,"storedBytes":14711,"truncated":false},"lastDemoChecke